DESCRIPTION:A standard Django project involves working with multiple files 
 and folders from the start. Let's see how the work with a Django project w
 hen we have only one file in project. This solution automatically transfor
 ms Django into a microservice-oriented async framework with "batteries inc
 luded” philosophy.
